        // daw (Delete Around Word) deletes the current word and the single space that follows it. It is designed to keep your sentence structure clean; by removing the trailing space, the surrounding words snap together perfectly without leaving a double space behind.
        Complete_Word_Deletion: Complete_Word_Deletion {
